<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">template</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">Draggable</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">view</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">view</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">template</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span></code></pre>"}